### Suggested files

```text
src/
  main.cpp

  ui/
    app_state.hpp              // domain/UI state structs if needed
    view_models.hpp            // small immutable render inputs

    theme.hpp
    theme.cpp

    panes/
      status_pane.hpp
      status_pane.cpp
      inventory_pane.hpp
