## Include dependency guidance

### For pure pane headers

Use:

```cpp
#include <ftxui/dom/elements.hpp>
```

because public signatures expose `ftxui::Element`.

Avoid:

```cpp
#include <ftxui/component/component.hpp>
#include <ftxui/component/screen_interactive.hpp>
```

unless the header exposes component construction.

### For component adapter headers

Use:

```cpp
#include <ftxui/component/component.hpp>
```

because public signatures expose `ftxui::Component`.

### For source files

Prefer source-local includes for heavy dependencies:

```cpp
// inventory_component.cpp
#include "ui/components/inventory_component.hpp"

#include "ui/panes/inventory_pane.hpp"
#include <ftxui/component/component.hpp>
#include <ftxui/component/event.hpp>
```

### For utility headers

Prefer no FTXUI dependency:

```cpp
std::string TruncateUtf8ForDisplay(std::string_view text, int width);
std::string FormatPercent(int current, int max);
```

If the utility returns `ftxui::Color` or `ftxui::Decorator`, it is not a generic utility; put it under `ui/theme` or `ui/ftxui_util`.

